problem:thershold breaking point(TCS,HCL,accenture,wipro,infosys)

-->breaking point
-->first exceeding limit
-->load threshold problem
Find first index where prefix sum exceeds threshold.

Input Format

n, threshold array

Constraints

1 ≤ n ≤ 10⁵

Output Format

index or -1

Sample Input 0

5 10
2 3 4 5 6
Sample Output 0

3
Sample Input 1

4 5
1 2 3 4
Sample Output 1

2

input:
5 10 n=5 // size threshold value=10
2 3 4 5 6 //elements

0 1  2 3 4 

0+2=2
2>10 no
2+3=5
5>10 no
5+4 = 9
9>10 no
9+5=14
14>10 yes
print according to the index value 

so the output will be :3

import java.util.*;
public class solution{
public static void main(String[] args){
 Scanner in=new Scanner(System.in);
 int n=in.nextInt();
 int t=in.nextInt();
 int sum=0;
 for(int i=0;i<n;i++){
 sum+=in.nexInt();
if(sum>t){
System.out.println(i);
return;
}
}
System.out.println(-1);
}}










